#: includes/settings/content/developers.php:816
msgid ""
"Pagination nav. It is a previous link, an ordered list with one item per "
"page, and a next link. Each link has data-tcres-query-listing-page set to "
"prev, next, or the page number. The current link uses is-current and aria-"
"current=\"page\". An unavailable link uses aria-disabled=\"true\". The "
"sample number href is reused for every page: a {page} token is replaced, "
"otherwise the path segment equal to the sample page is replaced. A filter or "
"an order change goes back to page 1 and replaces the grid. Previous and next "
"labels stay; the sample item is cloned to match the new page count."
msgstr ""
"Pagination nav. It is a previous link, an ordered list with one item per "
"page, and a next link. Each link has data-tcres-query-listing-page set to "
"prev, next, or the page number. The current link uses is-current and aria-"
"current=\"page\". An unavailable link uses aria-disabled=\"true\". The "
"sample number href is reused for every page: a {page} token is replaced, "
"otherwise the path segment equal to the sample page is replaced. A filter or "
"an order change goes back to page 1 and replaces the grid. Previous and next "
"labels stay; the sample item is cloned to match the new page count."

